  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1189523/description_6488e172-95fe-46d0-b211-c47ba4ba1b76.png\" alt=\"\">\n<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1189523/description_b45b4497-b99b-478b-bb78-816ecf83e727.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1189523/description_4bd2641e-5eea-4372-ad16-c23019a5a43e.png\" alt=\"\">\n<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1189523/description_4b74b831-b235-42c6-ab80-34dd9c3f2ce1.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1189523/description_a2e4b377-84ff-4037-8f79-7e1a07b626ec.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<hr>\n<h2><strong>資料包支援</strong></h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1189523/description_97ed6f11-026f-449b-97ee-86e1500c2794.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>您幾乎可以將此模組中的所有內容資料包化，包括：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>自訂 Mega 進化</li>\n<li>極巨化（G-Max）形態</li>\n<li>自訂寶可夢屬性</li>\n<li>以及更多功能</li>\n</ul>\n<p>📖 維基：\n<a href=\"https://github.com/yajatkaul/CobblemonMegaShowdown/wiki\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://github.com/yajatkaul/CobblemonMegaShowdown/wiki</a></p>\n<hr>\n<h2><strong>配件整合</strong></h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1189523/description_b8f1e56c-7f90-47dd-948c-e096d5b53918.png\" alt=\"\">\n<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1189523/description_231b647f-88e3-485a-b07f-1ed063068956.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<hr>\n<h2><strong>功能特色</strong></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><p>可資料包化的功能</p></li>\n<li><p>外觀飾品支援</p></li>\n<li><p>所有形態變更</p></li>\n<li><p>支援騎乘</p></li>\n<li><p>全部 48 種 Mega 進化</p></li>\n<li><p>配件支援</p></li>\n<li><p>新增原始獸</p></li>\n<li><p>新增戰鬥機制：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>太晶化機制</li>\n<li>Mega 進化</li>\n<li>Z 招式</li>\n<li>極巨化</li>\n<li>究極爆發</li></ul></li>\n<li><p>所有融合寶可夢</p></li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2><strong>致謝名單</strong></h2>\n<p>所有致謝名單與模型使用細節如下：\n👉 <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1VPRia2W_7wqhbwSGv1845qmXw_FtjZ4FDhr58fRZFSM/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1VPRia2W_7wqhbwSGv1845qmXw_FtjZ4FDhr58fRZFSM/edit?usp=sharing</a></p>\n<hr>\n<h2><strong>不相容項目</strong></h2>\n<p>已知不相容的附加模組／資料包：\n👉 <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1pVLaT_dkQnQ2oO1IrJwf0RzkZNgqds2RMlYYOtqBVGg/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1pVLaT_dkQnQ2oO1IrJwf0RzkZNgqds2RMlYYOtqBVGg/edit?usp=sharing</a></p>\n<hr>\n<h2><strong>社群連結</strong></h2>\n<p>本模組包含現存的所有 Mega 進化形態。如需任何協助或提問，歡迎加入我的 Discord：</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/egeWG4GXhN\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/8a41e45e-aac9-44e5-8b69-55a81058ecbf_875x280.png\" alt=\"加入我們的 Discord 伺服器\"></a></p>",
